mbie</surname><given-names>WR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Maize genome sequencing by methylation filtration</article-title><source>Science</source><year>2003</year><volume>302</volume><fpage>2115</fpage><lpage>2117</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14684820</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1126/science.1091265</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rabinowicz</surname><given-names>PD</given-names></name><name><surname>Schutz</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Dedhia</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Yordan</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Parnell</surname><given-names>LD</given-names></name><name><surname>Stein</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>McCombie</surname><given-names>WR</given-names></name><name><surname>Martienssen</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Differential methylation of genes and retrotransposons facilitates shotgun sequencing of the maize genome</article-title><source>Nature Genetics</source><year>1999</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>305</fpage><lpage>308</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10545948</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/15479</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Whitelaw</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Barbazuk</surname><given-names>WB</given-names></name><name><surname>Pertea</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Chan</surname><given-names>AP</given-names></name><name><surname>Cheung</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Zheng</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>van Heeringen</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>K